te_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Christian A</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/129553-so-about-red-stick?p=129791#post129791\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He's an old, old wolf. The lots and lots of dice he has in his brawl dice pool don't make up for his senility, insanity, disconnect with the mortal world, etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>Harmony score of 5; it only manifests as if the Hulk had a monumental Sweet Tooth.<br /> <br /> He would eat humans, tho.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T13:58:05-07:00","id":130143,"title":"","content":"Silver Jaws, Primal Form and Savage Might will negate pretty much anything else thrown at him. Primal Urge 9 is 10 essence per turn, Savage Might turns that into 30 extra Strength. Per turn. Grappling is Strength-based, even with Red Stick in Hishu, Dar-Us would have a -39 to his Str+Brawl roll to pull off grappling moves. I think Red Stick can take him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/137x125q90/745/a5GS5M.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/802-amaterasu","name":"amaterasu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/av